{"seq":2,"slug":"sources-nondeterminism","title":"非确定性来源","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-replay-determinism/foundations/sources-nondeterminism","wordCount":1579,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"非确定性来源\">非确定性来源</h1><p>确定性失败几乎从不是「算错了」，而是「这次算的和上次不一样」。一段代码本身没有 bug，单机重跑也好好的，可一旦跨机器、跨进程、跨平台，某一帧就悄悄分叉。这一篇把这些「合法但不可复现」的来源逐项点名，做成一份排查清单——后面所有篇的工作，本质上都是在堵住这张清单上的某一项。把它当作 desync 时的「嫌疑人名单」来读。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>非确定性的共同特征是：结果依赖了某个「不属于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(S_t, I_t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的隐藏输入」。纯函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(S_t, I_t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 一旦偷偷读取了墙上时间、线程到达顺序、容器的实现细节或系统熵，它就不再是纯函数。下图按「藏在哪一层」把来源分成五类。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[非确定性来源] --&gt; B[数值层&lt;br/&gt;浮点跨平台 / FMA / fast-math]&#10;  A --&gt; C[容器层&lt;br/&gt;哈希遍历序 / 指针排序 / 浮点 key]&#10;  A --&gt; D[并发层&lt;br/&gt;线程调度 / 原子顺序 / 并行归约]&#10;  A --&gt; E[环境层&lt;br/&gt;墙上时间 / 系统熵 / 本地化 / 平台 API]&#10;  A --&gt; F[迭代层&lt;br/&gt;未播种 RNG / 提前退出 / 帧依赖]&#10;  B --&gt; G[desync]&#10;  C --&gt; G&#10;  D --&gt; G&#10;  E --&gt; G&#10;  F --&gt; G\">flowchart TD\n  A[非确定性来源] --&gt; B[数值层&lt;br/&gt;浮点跨平台 / FMA / fast-math]\n  A --&gt; C[容器层&lt;br/&gt;哈希遍历序 / 指针排序 / 浮点 key]\n  A --&gt; D[并发层&lt;br/&gt;线程调度 / 原子顺序 / 并行归约]\n  A --&gt; E[环境层&lt;br/&gt;墙上时间 / 系统熵 / 本地化 / 平台 API]\n  A --&gt; F[迭代层&lt;br/&gt;未播种 RNG / 提前退出 / 帧依赖]\n  B --&gt; G[desync]\n  C --&gt; G\n  D --&gt; G\n  E --&gt; G\n  F --&gt; G</pre><p>下表把每一类的典型表现、为什么不可复现、以及由哪一篇负责根治列在一起，方便对照排查。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类别</th>\n<th>典型表现</th>\n<th>为什么不可复现</th>\n<th>根治篇</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数值层</td>\n<td>浮点结果跨 CPU/编译器不同</td>\n<td>IEEE 754 留有实现自由，FMA/fast-math 改变舍入</td>\n<td><a href=\"fixed-point-vs-float\">定点数与浮点</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>容器层</td>\n<td>遍历哈希表顺序每次不同</td>\n<td>顺序依赖哈希种子/插入历史/内存地址</td>\n<td>本篇（约束写法）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并发层</td>\n<td>多线程归约结果抖动</td>\n<td>浮点加法不满足结合律，到达顺序不定</td>\n<td><a href=\"../deterministic-sim/deterministic-update-loop\">确定性更新循环</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>环境层</td>\n<td>用 <code>Time.now()</code> 驱动逻辑</td>\n<td>墙上时间不可复现</td>\n<td><a href=\"../deterministic-sim/deterministic-update-loop\">确定性更新循环</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>迭代层</td>\n<td>用全局 RNG、调用顺序不定</td>\n<td>共享状态被并发/分支扰动</td>\n<td><a href=\"../deterministic-sim/rng-determinism\">随机数确定性</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"数值层-浮点的合法不一致\">数值层：浮点的合法不一致</h2><p>IEEE 754 规定了 <code>+ - * /</code> 与 <code>sqrt</code> 的精确舍入，却给超越函数（<code>sin</code>、<code>cos</code>、<code>exp</code>）、表达式求值顺序、扩展精度中间值、以及 FMA（融合乘加）留下了实现自由。结果是同一段 <code>a*b + c</code>，在支持 FMA 的 CPU 上一步算完只舍入一次，在不支持的 CPU 上分两步舍入两次，末位就可能差 1——在反复迭代的物理里，这个 1 会指数级放大成可见的位置偏差。<code>-ffast-math</code> 更激进，它允许编译器假设浮点满足结合律、忽略 NaN/Inf，从而重排运算，彻底牺牲可复现性。这一类是最隐蔽也最常见的根因，它单独成篇：<a href=\"fixed-point-vs-float\">定点数与浮点</a>。本篇只提醒：单机一致不等于跨平台一致，浮点的「错」往往只在换机器时才现形。</p>\n<h2 id=\"容器层-遍历顺序的隐性依赖\">容器层：遍历顺序的隐性依赖</h2><p>第二大类来自数据结构。哈希表（<code>unordered_map</code>、<code>HashMap</code>、<code>dict</code>）的遍历顺序依赖哈希种子、插入历史，有些语言甚至每次进程启动随机化种子。如果你的模拟里有「遍历所有实体逐个施力」这样的循环，遍历顺序不同→浮点累加顺序不同（浮点加法不满足结合律）→结果分叉。修法是纪律性的：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>模拟用的集合一律用有序容器（按稳定的实体 ID 排序），或显式 <code>sort</code> 后再遍历。</li>\n<li>排序键绝不能是指针地址或哈希值——它们跨运行不稳定。</li>\n<li>绝不用浮点做哈希表的 key 或排序键。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这一类没有专门篇，因为它就是一条写代码的纪律；但它在物理的接触点排序里再次出现，由 <a href=\"../deterministic-sim/deterministic-physics\">确定性物理</a> 强调如何稳定排序碰撞对。</p>\n<h2 id=\"并发层-调度与归约的不确定\">并发层：调度与归约的不确定</h2><p>多线程是确定性的天敌：线程到达临界区的顺序由操作系统调度决定，不可复现。把一个「对所有实体求合力」的归约并行化，各线程的局部和以不定顺序相加——而浮点加法不满足结合律，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>（</mtext><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">（a+b)+c \\neq a+(b+c)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 在末位上成立——于是每次跑结果都微抖。对策不是禁用并行，而是让并行确定：固定分块、固定归约树形状、或先并行算出各分块结果再按固定顺序串行合并。详细的「确定性并行」策略归 <a href=\"../deterministic-sim/deterministic-update-loop\">确定性更新循环</a>，本篇先点明：任何「结果顺序依赖线程到达顺序」的写法都是定时炸弹。</p>\n<h2 id=\"环境层-墙上时间-熵与本地化\">环境层：墙上时间、熵与本地化</h2><p>第四类来自向操作系统借数。最典型的是用真实流逝时间驱动逻辑：<code>dt = now() - last</code> 让每帧步长随机器负载浮动，模拟立刻不可复现——这正是固定步长的动机，见 <a href=\"../deterministic-sim/deterministic-update-loop\">确定性更新循环</a>。其它环境陷阱包括：直接读系统熵（<code>/dev/urandom</code>、<code>rand()</code> 无种子）做游戏逻辑随机（归 <a href=\"../deterministic-sim/rng-determinism\">随机数确定性</a>）；依赖本地化设置（区域决定的小数点、大小写折叠、字符串比较顺序）；以及平台 API 的细微差异（不同平台的 <code>atan2</code> 末位实现不同——Box2D 在 2024 年正是靠自己实现 <code>atan2f</code> 才达成跨平台确定性，见 box2d.org 的 determinism 复盘）。原则是：游戏逻辑里出现的每一个数，都必须来自 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(S_t, I_t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，不能来自环境。</p>\n<h2 id=\"迭代层-随机数与帧间状态\">迭代层：随机数与帧间状态</h2><p>最后一类藏在迭代结构里。用全局共享的随机数发生器、而其调用顺序又因分支或并发而不定，就会让随机序列分叉；用「未播种」或「按真实时间播种」的 RNG 则连同一份输入都无法复现。此外，「提前退出」的循环（找到第一个满足条件的对象就 break，而对象集合遍历顺序不稳定）也会引入分叉。这些都收敛到一个要求：随机必须来自一个可播种、可序列化、调用点固定的 PRNG，由 <a href=\"../deterministic-sim/rng-determinism\">随机数确定性</a> 专门处理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>非确定性 = 函数偷偷读了不属于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(S_t, I_t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的隐藏输入；单机一致≠跨平台一致。</li>\n<li>五类嫌疑：数值（浮点/FMA/fast-math）、容器（遍历序）、并发（调度/归约）、环境（时间/熵/本地化/平台 API）、迭代（RNG/提前退出）。</li>\n<li>容器层靠纪律（有序容器、稳定 ID 排序、不用指针/浮点做键）即可堵住。</li>\n<li>其余四类各有专篇根治；这张清单本身是 desync 排查时的嫌疑人名单。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"fixed-point-vs-float\">定点数与浮点</a>——根治数值层最硬的来源。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../practice/desync-debugging\">不同步调试</a>——desync 发生时如何二分回这张清单。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../multiplayer-netcode/foundations/netcode-fundamentals\">多人 netcode · netcode 基础</a>——联机为何对这些来源零容忍。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"非确定性来源","id":"非确定性来源"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"数值层：浮点的合法不一致","id":"数值层-浮点的合法不一致"},{"level":2,"text":"容器层：遍历顺序的隐性依赖","id":"容器层-遍历顺序的隐性依赖"},{"level":2,"text":"并发层：调度与归约的不确定","id":"并发层-调度与归约的不确定"},{"level":2,"text":"环境层：墙上时间、熵与本地化","id":"环境层-墙上时间-熵与本地化"},{"level":2,"text":"迭代层：随机数与帧间状态","id":"迭代层-随机数与帧间状态"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"为何需要确定性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-replay-determinism/foundations/why-determinism"},"next":{"title":"定点数与浮点","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-replay-determinism/foundations/fixed-point-vs-float"}}